      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">About $650 more than steel buys a tank with a tag that can run decades instead of a dozen years. Free written estimates across St. John's and the Avalon, licensed and insured, and the same number answers 24/7 if your tag has already expired.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
